      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若只有如“烈火”般猛烈的斗志，\n技术和体能就容易失衡，难以落实守护的意志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7f6c0be1bfc9f201e6998df233c0075cfd9159964d8c671292a40328b54370e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
