      "uid": "zhcn:599c476c690dd648e0d2be00",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，若只有如“止水”般冷静的理智，\n将导致面临困难时裹足不前，在该守护时迟疑……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c51880137f4ebf93c67a2129fbcebf63a6dc234b372122b387537d242669093d",
