      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“火水合一”便是调和了“烈火”与“止水”，\n在关键时刻能毫不犹豫地以正确的方法进行守护的境界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ec7402d07e11ca99bca0d94f64b78b1eb44a3a3903ad40a4969e0a6937552c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
