      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们的流派的作法，是透过\n倾注身心之力演练“形”，促成“火水合一”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "963f62a18eb3c5d4ec305426619ac4654d0e60eb9b4d60ade3c87e2d1b942a5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
