    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7512ab0be501e621f2d99df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们第一次见面的那天，她也像小时候那样，\n透过演练“形”压抑自己对选拔赛的激情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "870e0dddd21abd87d110fcd20dfc6da254cf6d28579ab91fe0bf72a66837878d",
